1. Non-Commercial Use (Individuals / Organizations)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Nx Architecture may be used free of charge under the following conditions:

- Use by individual developers
- Use for non-commercial purposes
- Use for academic research or educational purposes
- Use in non-commercial OSS projects

※ Even individual developers are considered “commercial users” when applying this
   architecture in commissioned work, contract development, or any paid service
   provided to corporations or organizations.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Evaluation and Proof-of-Concept (PoC)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Evaluation or PoC use of Nx Architecture by corporations or organizations is permitted
as non-commercial under the following conditions:

- Evaluation period is limited to 30 days
- Use in production environments is prohibited
- Use as part of any commercial activity is prohibited
- Continued use beyond the evaluation period requires a commercial license

※ Individual developers may evaluate without time restrictions.

