3. Commercial Use (Corporations / Organizations)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
The following activities constitute commercial use and require either a separate
commercial license or enrollment in the designated GitHub Sponsors program:

- Use in production environments
- Integration into SaaS / ASP / cloud services
- Use of Nx Architecture in paid services or products
- Building commercial systems using the Divergence Oscillation Model
