- PoC or evaluation exceeding 30 days
- Commercial implementations using Nx Architecture specifications or abstract models
- Use by corporations or for-profit entities for business operations
  (including internal tools and internal workflow systems)

[Commercial Usage Rights (Sponsors / Individual Contracts)]
- Commercial usage rights are granted only during active sponsorship or during the
