4. Specifications and Abstract Models
----------------------------------------------------------------------
The specifications of Nx Architecture, its abstract model known as the Divergence
Oscillation Model, and the architecture used to operate it (Nexsus UI–DB Transformation
Architecture) are treated as copyrighted works under this license.

- Specification review, analysis, and academic research are permitted as non-commercial use.
- Standardization by organizations (ISO / W3C / IETF, etc.) is permitted as non-commercial use.

However, commercial implementations using the specifications or abstract models,
or commercial use of Nx Architecture’s implementation (code or internal structure),
are subject to the commercial-use provisions of this license.

[Prohibition of Clean-Room Reimplementation]
Any person who agrees to this license and views or uses this software or its specifications /
internal structures is prohibited from independently developing, clean-room reimplementing,
or providing software for commercial purposes that possesses functionality substantially
identical or equivalent to the design philosophy or abstract models of this software
(including the Divergence Oscillation Model and UI–DB node structures).

